  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dad, Lily, and Mia ride bikes. They go to the beach. The sea is blue. The sand is white. \"Stop here,\" says Dad. They put the bikes under a tree. \"Let's swim!\" says Mia.",
      "Lily jumps in the sea. Mia swims too. Dad looks at them. \"Point to your eye,\" says Dad. Lily points to her eye. \"Point to your ear.\" Mia points to her ear. \"Point to your face!\" Lily smiles. She has sand on her face!",
      "Mia finds a shell. It is small and pink. \"Look, a shell!\" says Mia. \"Put it to your ear.\" Dad smiles. Mia does it. She smiles. \"Is it a song?\" asks Lily. \"No, it is the sea!\" says Mia. Then they ride home."
    ],
    "summary": "Dad, Lily, and Mia ride bikes to the beach. They swim, play a pointing game, and find a shell.",
